@startuml diagrama-de-clases-dominio
title Diagrama de clases - dominio de Netplus

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
	BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
	BorderColor #183153
	ArrowColor #183153
}
skinparam enum {
	BackgroundColor #E6FFFB
	BorderColor #0D9488
}
hide empty members

note as N_conventions
	Convenciones
	- Nombres de clases y atributos en inglés (camelCase).
	- Las tablas usan snake_case (ver 04-modelo-de-datos.puml).
	- Este diagrama muestra clases, no instancias.
	- Los servicios están en el diagrama siguiente.
end note

enum Role {
	admin
	viewer
}

enum UploadStatus {
	rejected
	validated
	queued
	processing
	imported
	failed
	discarded
}

enum FileType {
	marks
	leaves
	monthly_hours
}

enum MarkKind {
	entry
	exit
}

enum LeaveStatus {
	approved
	rejected
	revoked
}

enum Severity {
	error
	warning
}

enum ChartType {
	bar
	line
	pie
}

class User {
	- id : long
	- username : string
	- passwordHash : string
	- role : Role
	- active : boolean
	- createdAt : datetime
	+ verifyPassword(plain : string) : boolean
	+ changePassword(plain : string)
	+ activate()
	+ deactivate()
	+ canLogin() : boolean
}

class Session {
	- tokenHash : string
	- expiresAt : datetime
	- createdAt : datetime
	+ isExpired() : boolean
}

class Upload {
	- id : long
	- originalName : string
	- storageKey : string [0..1]
	- status : UploadStatus
	- summary : ImportSummary [0..1]
	- uploadedBy : User
	- createdAt : datetime
	+ markRejected()
	+ markValidated(summary : ImportSummary)
	+ markQueued()
	+ markProcessing()
	+ markImported(summary : ImportSummary)
	+ markFailed(reason : string)
	+ markDiscarded()
}

class ImportSummary <<value object>> {
	- sheets : List<SheetSummary>
}

class SheetSummary <<value object>> {
	- sheetName : string
	- fileType : FileType
	- periodYear : int [0..1]
	- periodMonth : int [0..1]
	- rowsRead : int
	- created : int
	- updated : int
	- unchanged : int
	- selected : boolean
}

class ImportIssue {
	- id : long
	- sheetName : string
	- rowNumber : int [0..1]
	- columnName : string [0..1]
	- severity : Severity
	- ruleCode : string
	- message : string
}

class Employee {
	- id : long
	- code : int
	- firstName : string
	- lastName : string [0..1]
	- company : string
}

class Department {
	- id : long
	- code : int [0..1]
	- name : string
	- nameKey : string
}

class Position {
	- id : long
	- code : int [0..1]
	- name : string [0..1]
	- nameKey : string [0..1]
}

abstract class ImportedRecord {
	- id : long
}

class AttendanceMark {
	- markedAt : datetime
	- kind : MarkKind
	- method : string
	- source : string
}

class LeaveRequest {
	- startsAt : datetime
	- endsAt : datetime
	- reason : string [0..1]
	- recordedAt : datetime
	- leaveType : string
	- status : LeaveStatus
	- approvalComment : string [0..1]
	- approver : string [0..1]
	+ durationHours() : decimal
	+ overlaps(from : date, to : date) : boolean
}

class MonthlyHours {
	- periodYear : int
	- periodMonth : int
	- supplementaryMinutes : int
	- extraMinutes : int
	- nightMinutes : int
	- notes : string [0..1]
	+ totalMinutes() : int
}

class DashboardConfig {
	- id : long
	- name : string
	- published : boolean
	- createdBy : User
	- updatedAt : datetime
	+ publish()
	+ unpublish()
	+ isVisibleTo(user : User) : boolean
}

class ChartConfig <<value object>> {
	- source : FileType
	- type : ChartType
	- title : string
	- dimension : string
	- measure : string
}

class FilterConfig <<value object>> {
	- field : string
	- kind : string
}

class AuditEvent {
	- id : long
	- userId : long [0..1]
	- action : string
	- resourceType : string
	- resourceId : long [0..1]
	- detail : string [0..1]
	- createdAt : datetime
}

User "1" --> "0..*" Upload : uploadedBy
User "1" --> "0..*" Session
User "1" --> "0..*" DashboardConfig : createdBy
User "0..1" <-- "0..*" AuditEvent : actor
Upload "1" *-- "0..*" ImportIssue
Upload "1" o-- "0..1" ImportSummary
ImportSummary "1" *-- "1..*" SheetSummary
Upload "1" --> "0..*" ImportedRecord : último archivo\nque lo escribió
Employee "1" --> "0..*" ImportedRecord
Department "1" --> "0..*" ImportedRecord
Position "0..1" --> "0..*" AttendanceMark
Position "0..1" --> "0..*" MonthlyHours
ImportedRecord <|-- AttendanceMark
ImportedRecord <|-- LeaveRequest
ImportedRecord <|-- MonthlyHours
DashboardConfig "1" *-- "0..*" ChartConfig
DashboardConfig "1" *-- "0..*" FilterConfig

User --> Role
Upload --> UploadStatus
SheetSummary --> FileType
ChartConfig --> FileType
ChartConfig --> ChartType
AttendanceMark --> MarkKind
LeaveRequest --> LeaveStatus
ImportIssue --> Severity

note right of Upload
	Estados:
	rejected (sin archivo guardado)
	validated -> queued -> processing
	validated -> processing (la API procesa)
	validated -> discarded
	processing -> imported | failed
end note

note bottom of ImportedRecord
	Clave natural y reimportación (RN-12):
	AttendanceMark: empleado + fecha y hora + tipo (se omite)
	LeaveRequest: empleado + inicio + fin + código de pago (se actualiza)
	MonthlyHours: empleado + año + mes (se reemplaza)
end note

note bottom of ChartConfig
	ChartConfig y FilterConfig son objetos
	de valor guardados dentro de config_json.
end note
@enduml

@startuml diagrama-de-clases-servicios
title Diagrama de clases - importación y servicios de Netplus

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
	BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
	BorderColor #183153
	ArrowColor #183153
}
skinparam enum {
	BackgroundColor #E6FFFB
	BorderColor #0D9488
}
skinparam package {
	BorderColor #183153
}
hide empty members

note as N_conventions
	Las clases en gris claro sin detalle (User, Upload, etc.) se definen
	en el diagrama de dominio. Los servicios consultan AuthorizationPolicy
	en el backend (RN-22).
end note

package "Dominio (resumen)" {
	class User
	class Session
	class Upload
	class ImportIssue
	abstract class ImportedRecord
	class AttendanceMark
	class DashboardConfig
	enum Role
	enum FileType
}

package "Importación" {
	class ExcelReader {
		+ open(reader : io.Reader) : Workbook
		+ sheetNames() : List<string>
		+ rows(sheet : string) : RowIterator
	}

	interface SheetParser {
		+ fileType() : FileType
		+ matches(header : SheetHeader) : boolean
		+ parse(rows : RowIterator) : ParseResult
	}

	class MarksSheetParser
	class LeavesSheetParser
	class MonthlyHoursSheetParser

	class CellNormalizer {
		+ toInt(cell : any) : int
		+ toDate(cell : any, layout : string) : datetime
		+ toMinutes(cell : any) : int
		+ cleanText(cell : any) : string
		+ nameKey(text : string) : string
	}

	class ParseResult <<value object>> {
		- records : List<ImportedRecord>
		- issues : List<ImportIssue>
		+ hasErrors() : boolean
	}
}

package "Servicios de aplicación" {
	class AppConfig {
		- mode : string
		- webBindIp : string
		- cookieSecure : boolean
		- maxUploadBytes : long
		- heavyRows : int
		- heavyBytes : long
		- loginAttemptLimit : int
		+ isServerMode() : boolean
	}

	class AuthorizationPolicy {
		+ can(role : Role, action : string) : boolean
		+ canSeeFreeText(role : Role) : boolean
	}

	class AuthService {
		+ login(username : string, password : string) : Session
		+ logout(session : Session)
		- checkAttemptLimit(username : string)
	}

	class UserService {
		+ createFirstAdmin(username : string, password : string) : User
		+ createViewer(username : string, password : string) : User
		+ resetPassword(userId : long, plain : string)
		+ setActive(userId : long, active : boolean)
	}

	class ImportService {
		+ preview(file : io.Reader, actor : User) : Upload
		+ confirm(uploadId : long, sheets : List<string>, actor : User)
		+ discard(uploadId : long, actor : User)
		+ isHeavy(upload : Upload) : boolean
	}

	class ImportWorker {
		+ run()
	}

	class WorkedHoursCalculator {
		+ pairMarks(marks : List<AttendanceMark>) : List<WorkSession>
		+ incomplete(marks : List<AttendanceMark>) : List<AttendanceMark>
	}

	class DashboardService {
		+ save(config : DashboardConfig)
		+ publish(id : long)
		+ listFor(user : User) : List<DashboardConfig>
		+ query(id : long, filters : List<FilterConfig>, from : date, to : date, actor : User) : ResultSet
		+ export(id : long, format : string, actor : User) : File
	}

	class AuditService {
		+ record(userId : long, action : string, resourceType : string, resourceId : long)
	}
}

' Importación
SheetParser <|.. MarksSheetParser
SheetParser <|.. LeavesSheetParser
SheetParser <|.. MonthlyHoursSheetParser
MarksSheetParser ..> CellNormalizer
LeavesSheetParser ..> CellNormalizer
MonthlyHoursSheetParser ..> CellNormalizer
SheetParser ..> ParseResult
SheetParser ..> FileType
ParseResult ..> ImportedRecord
ParseResult ..> ImportIssue

' Servicios
AuthService ..> User
AuthService ..> Session
AuthService ..> AuditService
UserService ..> User
UserService ..> AuditService
ImportService ..> ExcelReader
ImportService ..> SheetParser
ImportService ..> Upload
ImportService ..> AppConfig
ImportService ..> AuditService
ImportWorker ..> ImportService : confirm
WorkedHoursCalculator ..> AttendanceMark
DashboardService ..> DashboardConfig
DashboardService ..> WorkedHoursCalculator
DashboardService ..> AuthorizationPolicy
DashboardService ..> AuditService
AuthorizationPolicy ..> Role

note bottom of ImportWorker
	Solo en modo servidor.
	Toma tareas desde Redis.
end note

note bottom of CellNormalizer
	Absorbe las rarezas de los archivos de ejemplo:
	texto en lugar de fechas y números, duraciones
	[h]:mm o h:mm, IDs de texto o número y espacios sobrantes.
end note
@enduml

' Diagramas de clases de Netplus (versión final).
' Este archivo contiene dos diagramas:
'   1. diagrama-de-clases-dominio: entidades, objetos de valor y enumeraciones.
'   2. diagrama-de-clases-servicios: importación de Excel y servicios de aplicación.
' Las reglas RN-xx y VAL-xx están definidas en 01-analisis.md.
